#. ja: 月光の強化薬
#. de: Fläschchen[p] Mondlicht-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: fiole d'agent renforçant du clair de lune
#. column 2: flasks of moonshine brine
#. column 8: A luminous substance produced at the High Crucible of Al-Kimiya. One is probably better off not asking how the alchemical process of enhancing lunar envoy's weapons involves pickling. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Moonshine Brine
msgctxt "Item:38386:0:0"
msgid "flask of moonshine brine"
msgstr "Флакон самогонного рассола"

#. de: Fläschchen[p] Mondlicht-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: fioles d'agent renforçant du clair de lune
#. column 0: flask of moonshine brine
#. column 8: A luminous substance produced at the High Crucible of Al-Kimiya. One is probably better off not asking how the alchemical process of enhancing lunar envoy's weapons involves pickling. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Moonshine Brine
msgctxt "Item:38386:0:2"
msgid "flasks of moonshine brine"
msgstr "Флаконы самогонного рассола"

#. ja: アルキミヤ製薬堂で開発された錬金薬。<br>ルナエンヴォイ武器の強化に最適な性質を秘める。<br>かつて【武器】の強化に用いられていたが、今や技術の進歩により必要とされていない
#. de: Eine alchemistische Substanz aus dem Tiegel von Al-Kimiya. Sie verstärkt die Eigenschaften der Waffen der Mondgesandten.<br>(Wurde zur Verstärkung von Waffen benutzt, ist nun aber nicht mehr erforderlich.)
#. fr: Une mixture alchimique mise au point au Creuset de l'Al-Kimiya, parfaite pour renforcer les armes d'émissaire sélénien. De meilleures techniques ont été inventées depuis sa découverte, et plus personne ne l'utilise aujourd'hui.
#. column 0: flask of moonshine brine
#. column 2: flasks of moonshine brine
#. column 9: Moonshine Brine
msgctxt "Item:38386:0:8"
msgid "A luminous substance produced at the High Crucible of Al-Kimiya. One is probably better off not asking how the alchemical process of enhancing lunar envoy's weapons involves pickling. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
msgstr "Светящееся вещество, изготовленное в Высоком тигле аль-Кимии. Лучше не спрашивать, зачем при алхимическом усилении оружия лунных посланников его вымачивают в рассоле. Впрочем, новые технологии сделали это средство ненужным."

#. ja: 月光の強化薬
