#. fr: Agent renforçant du clair de lune
#. column 0: flask of moonshine brine
#. column 2: flasks of moonshine brine
#. column 8: A luminous substance produced at the High Crucible of Al-Kimiya. One is probably better off not asking how the alchemical process of enhancing lunar envoy's weapons involves pickling. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
msgctxt "Item:38386:0:9"
msgid "Moonshine Brine"
msgstr "Самогонный рассол"

#. ja: 月光の強化繊維
#. de: Bündel[p] Mondlicht-Gewebe
#. fr: rouleau de fibre renforcée du clair de lune
#. column 2: spools of moonshine twine
#. column 8: A luminous thread produced at the High Crucible of<br>Al-Kimiya, used to enhance the properties of lunar envoy's vestments in a thoroughly normal fashion. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Moonshine Twine
msgctxt "Item:38387:0:0"
msgid "spool of moonshine twine"
msgstr "Катушка самогонного шпагата"

