msgstr "Самогонный шпагат"

#. ja: 月光の硬化薬
#. de: Phiole[p] Mondlicht-Poliermittel
#. fr: fiole d'agent solidifiant du clair de lune
#. column 2: pots of moonshine shine
#. column 8: A luminous substance produced at the High Crucible of Al-Kimiya, used to polish lunar envoy's accessories to transcendent perfection. Through copious trial and error, the chances of accoutrements enhanced in such a manner blinding those who look upon them has been reduced to nearly zero. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Moonshine Shine
msgctxt "Item:38388:0:0"
msgid "pot of moonshine shine"
msgstr "Горшочек самогонного сияния"

#. de: Phiolen[p] Mondlicht-Poliermittel
#. fr: fioles d'agent solidifiant du clair de lune
#. column 0: pot of moonshine shine
#. column 8: A luminous substance produced at the High Crucible of Al-Kimiya, used to polish lunar envoy's accessories to transcendent perfection. Through copious trial and error, the chances of accoutrements enhanced in such a manner blinding those who look upon them has been reduced to nearly zero. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Moonshine Shine
msgctxt "Item:38388:0:2"
msgid "pots of moonshine shine"
msgstr "Горшочки самогонного сияния"

#. ja: アルキミヤ製薬堂で開発された錬金薬。<br>ルナエンヴォイアクセサリの硬化に最適な性質を秘める。<br>かつて【アクセサリ】の強化に用いられていたが、今や技術の進歩により必要とされていない
#. de: Eine alchemistische Substanz aus dem Tiegel von Al-Kimiya. Sie verstärkt die Eigenschaften von Accessoires der Mondgesandten.<br>(Wurde zur Verstärkung von Accessoires benutzt, ist nun aber nicht mehr erforderlich.)
#. fr: Une mixture alchimique mise au point au Creuset de l'Al-Kimiya, parfaite pour augmenter la solidité des accessoires d'émissaire sélénien. De meilleures techniques ont été inventées depuis sa découverte, et plus personne ne l'utilise aujourd'hui.
#. column 0: pot of moonshine shine
#. column 2: pots of moonshine shine
#. column 9: Moonshine Shine
msgctxt "Item:38388:0:8"
msgid "A luminous substance produced at the High Crucible of Al-Kimiya, used to polish lunar envoy's accessories to transcendent perfection. Through copious trial and error, the chances of accoutrements enhanced in such a manner blinding those who look upon them has been reduced to nearly zero. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
msgstr "Светящееся вещество, изготовленное в Высоком тигле аль-Кимии. Им полировали украшения лунных посланников до неземного блеска. После множества проб и ошибок риск ослепить окружающих почти свели к нулю. Но новые технологии сделали его ненужным."

#. ja: 月光の硬化薬
#. de: Mondlicht-Poliermittel
#. fr: Agent solidifiant du clair de lune
#. column 0: pot of moonshine shine
#. column 2: pots of moonshine shine
#. column 8: A luminous substance produced at the High Crucible of Al-Kimiya, used to polish lunar envoy's accessories to transcendent perfection. Through copious trial and error, the chances of accoutrements enhanced in such a manner blinding those who look upon them has been reduced to nearly zero. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
msgctxt "Item:38388:0:9"
msgid "Moonshine Shine"
msgstr "Самогонное сияние"

#. ja: 極薄型トームストーン
#. de: ultraleicht[a] Allagisch[a] Stein
#. fr: mémoquartz hyperfin
#. column 2: ultralight tomestones
#. column 8: A surpassingly small means of storing knowledge, this tomestone was clearly devised as a cost-saving measure, and accordingly lacks durability. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Ultralight Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:38389:0:0"
msgid "ultralight tomestone"
msgstr "Ультралёгкий томостон"

#. de: ultraleicht[a] Allagisch[a] Steine
#. fr: mémoquartz hyperfins
#. column 0: ultralight tomestone
#. column 8: A surpassingly small means of storing knowledge, this tomestone was clearly devised as a cost-saving measure, and accordingly lacks durability. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Ultralight Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:38389:0:2"
msgid "ultralight tomestones"
msgstr "Ультралёгкие томостоны"

#. ja: 古代の記憶が記されたアラグ文明の遺物。空前絶後に薄っぺらい。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Ein seltener und wunderschöner Allagischer Stein, der leichter ist als eine Feder und dennoch uraltes, allagisches Wissen enthält. Sein verschwindend geringes Gewicht ist zweifelsohne auf kostensparende Maßnahmen zurückzuführen. Einst rissen sich Sammler förmlich nach dieser Rarität, doch heutzutage findet man dafür keine Abnehmer mehr.
#. fr: Cette pierre, vestige de la civilisation allagoise, renferme des con<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ces ancestrales. Elle est si fine que son maniement est in<shy>croya<shy>ble<shy>ment délicat. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, elles ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: ultralight tomestone
#. column 2: ultralight tomestones
#. column 9: Ultralight Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:38389:0:8"
msgid "A surpassingly small means of storing knowledge, this tomestone was clearly devised as a cost-saving measure, and accordingly lacks durability. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares."
msgstr "Этот томостон хранит знания, но поразительно мал и явно создан ради экономии. Прочности ему тоже не хватает. Когда-то за такие томостоны готовы были отдать немало, но мода прошла, и теперь их больше не обменивают на другие товары."

#. ja: 極薄型トームストーン
#. de: Ultraleichter Allagischer Stein
#. fr: Mémoquartz hyperfin
#. column 0: ultralight tomestone
#. column 2: ultralight tomestones
#. column 8: A surpassingly small means of storing knowledge, this tomestone was clearly devised as a cost-saving measure, and accordingly lacks durability. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
msgctxt "Item:38389:0:9"
msgid "Ultralight Tomestone"
msgstr "Ультралёгкий томстоун"

