#. ja: 大妖異の風宝珠
#. de: Windperle
#. fr: orbe de maîtresse du vent
#. column 2: pearls of winds
#. column 8: The might of an archfiend is trapped within this precious jewel. When all is still, one can almost hear the muted keening of storm winds raging within...
#. column 9: Pearl of Winds
msgctxt "Item:38675:0:0"
msgid "pearl of winds"
msgstr "жемчужина ветров"

#. de: Windperlen
